      "writtenOn": "2021-11-16T17:52:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we want this flag to support all these cases:\n1. Wasm (no SIMD)\n2. Wasm SIMD via SSE compat headers\n3. Wasm SIMD via intrinsics (dec_wasm)\n\nWEBP_USE_SIMD\u003dOFF will set WEBP_HAVE_WASM_SIMD\u003dOFF, so we will not use SIMD at all.\nWEBP_USE_SIMD\u003dON cannot distinguish between case 2 and 3 if we don\u0027t have WEBP_ENABLE_WASM_SIMD. Because in cpu.cmake, it tries -msimd128, and the compile check will succeed, so we always first hit case 3.",
      "parentUuid": "7123807c_640eca46",
